OL,5,G0955 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FIn East Anglia, the dinner party
OL,7,     Fcompetition features a performance
OL,8,     Ffrom some unlikely rappers, a
OL,9,     Fconfusing spaghetti marrow main
OL,10,     Fcourse, too many cooks, and a fire
OL,11,     Falarm.
OL,12,G1100 Couples Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FIn South Wales, Rachael and Nick
OL,14,     Fcook dishes they've never made
OL,15,     Fbefore, Ameel shows off his powers
OL,16,     Fof memory recall, and Angela
OL,17,     Fbosses Jeff around as they prepare
OL,18,     Ftheir no-nonsense menu.
