OL,6,     FThe One with the Wedding Casino:
OL,7,     FThe last thing Linda wants is
OL,8,     Fanything tacky, garish or themed.
OL,9,     FGroom James didn't get the memo,
OL,10,     Fand has got a Las Vegas-inspired
OL,11,     Freception up his sleeve.
OL,12,G1300 Don't Tell the Bride
OL,13,     FThe Medieval One: Stephen's always
OL,14,     Fimagined his wedding would be a
OL,15,     Fgrand, medieval affair. So that's
OL,16,     Fexactly what he's planned for his
OL,17,     Fbride-to-be Shelley, who just
OL,18,     Fwants something normal.
